<p>Bordo, Michael D. (2007). "<a href="https://www.clevelandfed.org/publications/economic-commentary/2007/ec-20071201-a-brief-history-of-central-banks">A Brief History of Central Banks</a>," Economic Commentary. Cleveland: Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland, December.</p>

